direction: down
title: "C23 stable allocation ticket: custody before index admission"
"Admission" -> "StableTicketPool": "Reserve ticket plus index and terminal\nrecord capacity; exhaustion returns\nbefore allocator"
"StableTicketPool" -> "AllocatorInFlight": "Publish stable attempt and GC input\ncarrier; release pool lock before\nallocation"
"AllocatorInFlight" -> "UnrecordedReturn": "Native success is initially only\nlocal; nonescaping guard is an\nadmission premise"
"UnrecordedReturn" -> "PrivateCandidate": "Capture original base checked extent\nand allocator provenance in stable\nrecord"
"UnrecordedReturn" -> "Quarantine": "Unrecorded escape has no\nreconstructible pointer; unknown is\nretained and not retried"
"PrivateCandidate" -> "StorageIndex": "Commit keyed effect; unknown index\nresponse retains ticket and source\nroots"
"PrivateCandidate" -> "PrivateAbort": "Only known absent publication and\nsettled borrows permit original-base\nfree"
"PrivateAbort" -> "Quarantine": "Unknown free is not permission for a\nsecond free or cell reuse"
"StorageIndex" -> "TicketRetirement": "Observe commit root coverage and exact\nresult; cell recycling still requires\nreplay and observer grace"
